      "classMechanic_text": "",
      "class_facet": {
        "CgBbOrOSW59AdFUj": {
          "facet_cost": "",
          "facet_description": "<p>When you resolve the <strong>Magic Pair</strong> effect, if you attack with a weapon belonging to the <strong>arcane</strong> or <strong>thrown</strong> Category, you deal extra damage equal to <strong>[the common value of the resolved cards]</strong> and regain <strong>[twice the common value of the resolved cards]</strong> Mind Points (for instance, resolving a pair of 5s allows you to deal <strong>5</strong> extra damage and regain <strong>10</strong> Mind Points).</p>\n",
          "facet_offensive": "",
          "facet_target": "",
          "id": "${item.id}",
          "name": "Duel Master",
          "uuid": "Actor.N0e1hCr4wljnYZcJ.Item.CgBbOrOSW59AdFUj"
        },
        "IIBL3rYvS3yfbl6k": {
          "facet_cost": "1 Fabula Point",
          "facet_description": "<p>You may use an action and spend <strong>1 Fabula Point</strong> to vanish from the current scene, reappearing whenever you want during a <strong>different</strong> scene in which another Player Character is present. Describe how you escaped and miraculously got here!</p>",
          "facet_offensive": "",
          "facet_target": "Self",
          "id": "${item.id}",
          "name": "See you later",
          "uuid": "Actor.N0e1hCr4wljnYZcJ.Item.IIBL3rYvS3yfbl6k"
        },
        "Rrw1wklhQTlDdXY2": {
          "facet_cost": "1 Fabula Point",
          "facet_description": "<p>When you hit one or more creatures with an attack, you may spend <strong>1 Fabula Point.</strong> If you do, each of those creatures will be unable to perform any action that requires them to be able to see you until the start of your next turn.</p>",
          "facet_offensive": "",
          "facet_target": "Self",
          "id": "${item.id}",
          "name": "Vanish",
          "uuid": "Actor.N0e1hCr4wljnYZcJ.Item.Rrw1wklhQTlDdXY2"
        },
        "Wht9H1EqL37GGTjC": {
          "facet_cost": "",
          "facet_description": "<p>At the start of a conflict, you may spend 10 Mind Points. If you do, <strong>choose one option</strong> and apply it before the start of the first round:</p><ul><li><p>Perform a <strong>free attack</strong> with a weapon you have equipped</p></li><li><p>Perform a <strong>【🚫Hinder】</strong> or <strong>【❗️Objective】</strong> action. You also gain a bonus equal to <strong>【SL】</strong> to all Checks you perform as part of the chosen option.</p></li></ul>",
          "facet_offensive": "",
          "facet_target": "",
          "id": "${item.id}",
          "name": "High Speed",
          "uuid": "Actor.N0e1hCr4wljnYZcJ.Item.Wht9H1EqL37GGTjC"
        },
        "nlm2xyjdJYHhC6QH": {
          "facet_cost": "",
          "facet_description": "<p>When you hit a creature with an attack, if the attack <strong>only</strong> targeted that creature and they are suffering from <strong>one or more status effects</strong>, you may have it deal extra damage equal to <strong>【SL + the number of status effects on the creature】.</strong></p>",
          "facet_offensive": "",
          "facet_target": "",
          "id": "${item.id}",
          "name": "Cheap Shot",
          "uuid": "Actor.N0e1hCr4wljnYZcJ.Item.nlm2xyjdJYHhC6QH"
        },
        "pQ9Q1IHW6Qpc92Hr": {
          "facet_cost": "",
          "facet_description": "<p>As long as you have no <strong>shields</strong> and no <strong>martial armor</strong> equipped, your Defense score is increased by <strong>【SL】.</strong></p>",
          "facet_offensive": "",
          "facet_target": "",
          "id": "${item.id}",
          "name": "Dodge",
          "uuid": "Actor.N0e1hCr4wljnYZcJ.Item.pQ9Q1IHW6Qpc92Hr"
        },
        "rp1qS1LrTZuVKlO8": {
          "facet_cost": "",
          "facet_description": "<p>When you use the 【<strong>Soul Steal】</strong> Skill, you may target any number of creatures at the same time (you perform a single Check and compare it to the Magic Defense of each creature you are attempting to steal from).</p>",
          "facet_offensive": "",
          "facet_target": "",
          "id": "${item.id}",
          "name": "Pillage",
          "uuid": "Actor.N0e1hCr4wljnYZcJ.Item.rp1qS1LrTZuVKlO8"
        },
        "utm2DDuMQS0OvzT0": {
          "facet_cost": "",
          "facet_description": "<p>While you have one or more <strong>melee dagger</strong> weapons equipped, you gain a +1 bonus to <strong>Defense</strong> and <strong>Magic Defense</strong>, and you treat those weapons as also belonging to the <strong>brawling</strong>, <strong>sword</strong>, and <strong>thrown</strong> Categories for the purpose of Skills and effects.</p>\n<p>Additionally, your attacks with weapons that belong to the <strong>dagger</strong> Category may target creatures that cannot normally be targeted by melee attacks.</p>\n",
          "facet_offensive": "",
          "facet_target": "",
          "id": "${item.id}",
          "name": "Blade Adept",
          "uuid": "Actor.N0e1hCr4wljnYZcJ.Item.utm2DDuMQS0OvzT0"
        },
        "x2V8jQ3eTi82DI24": {
          "facet_cost": "",
          "facet_description": "<p>You may use an action to perform a <strong>【DEX + WLP】</strong> Check against the Magic Defense of a creature you can see. if you succeed and the target is a soldier, you recover <strong>【SL】</strong> Inventory Points.</p><p>Additionally, if they are an <strong>elite</strong> or <strong>champion</strong>, the GM gives you the target’s soul treasure, an item worth an amount of zenit <strong>equal to or lower than【the target's level multiplied by 30, or by 50 if they are a Villain】</strong>. This soul treasure will appear inside your backpack;</p><p class=\"rule\">a creature can be successfully stolen from with this Skill only once.</p><p class=\"bonus\">You gain a bonus equal to <strong>【SL】</strong> to your <strong>【DEX + WLP】</strong> Checks for this Skill.</p>",
          "facet_offensive": "",
          "facet_target": "One creature",
          "id": "${item.id}",
          "name": "Soul Steal",
          "uuid": "Actor.N0e1hCr4wljnYZcJ.Item.x2V8jQ3eTi82DI24"
        }
      },
