      "class_lore": "<blockquote><p>Be they criminals, rebels or spies, <strong>Rogues</strong> are more than willing to play dirty in order to get what they want. Rogues are generally quick, witty and elusive: while a few of them are infamous for being mostly concerned with their personal wealth and profit, many see themselves as fighting against injustice, tyranny, or social exclusion.</p><p>Tragically, it is quite common for Rogues to end up being painted as threats by those same people they fight for</p></blockquote>",
